{"case_id": "S08-AGENT-007", "question": "我写成 I=R/U，这一步哪里错了？只解释错误。", "mode": "real", "status": "completed", "answer": "你这一步错在把欧姆定律的公式写反了。\n\n因果逻辑颠倒了：电压是形成电流的原因，电阻起阻碍作用，所以电流大小由电压和电阻的比值决定，正确表达式只能是 I=U/R。你写成 R/U 不仅关系倒置，单位也对不上（电阻除以电压的单位是 Ω/V，根本不可能是电流单位 A）。直接按 I=U/R 改回去就行。", "analysis": {"teaching_mode": "diagnose", "physics_topic": "欧姆定律", "question_type": "概念辨析与纠错", "needs_rag": true, "missing_conditions": false, "image_required": false, "student_work_provided": true, "short_reason": "用户提供自写公式要求指出错误，属明确的教学诊断需求，不涉及数值计算。", "calculation_required": false}, "route": {"teaching_mode": "diagnose", "use_rag": true, "should_answer": true, "user_message": null, "use_tools": false}, "sources": [{"id": "KB-ELEC-003", "topic": "串并联灯泡亮度的判断条件", "source": "11.课后总结（物理）.docx", "score": 3.2941867765713284}, {"id": "KB-POWER-001", "topic": "电热器高低温档与总电阻", "source": "12.课后总结（物理）.docx", "score": 2.0516950186170395}, {"id": "KB-ELEC-002", "topic": "并联动态电路中的电表示数与功率", "source": "12.课后总结（物理）.docx", "score": 1.4623265736820719}], "tool_records": [], "trace": {"run_id": "24ac2206cdf94b86905f564a8c12859b", "case_id": "S08-AGENT-007", "started_at": "2026-08-03T10:24:17.085028+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-08-03T10:24:40.028205+00:00", "total_duration_ms": 22937.000000150874, "status": "completed", "total_model_requests": 2, "rag_searches": 1, "tool_executions": 0, "analysis_fallback": false, "teaching_mode": "diagnose", "use_rag": true, "use_tools": false, "steps": [{"name": "analyzer", "status": "success", "attempts": 1, "duration_ms": 10187.000000150874, "model_requests": 1, "error_type": null, "error_message": null, "metadata": {"fallback": false}}, {"name": "router", "status": "success", "attempts": 1, "duration_ms": 0.0, "model_requests": 0, "error_type": null, "error_message": null, "metadata": {"teaching_mode": "diagnose", "use_rag": true, "use_tools": false, "should_answer": true}}, {"name": "rag_retrieval", "status": "success", "attempts": 1, "duration_ms": 0.0, "model_requests": 0, "error_t